WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.464
Today’s lesson goal: Today’s lesson goal: create a simple class in C sharp. Add properties and a method. Construct objects and use them.

2
00:00:11.314 --> 00:00:20.890
Classes and objects: A class defines fields or properties. New creates an instance. Methods act on that instance’s data.

3
00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:32.156
Worked example: Book: Worked example: a Book with Title and IsRead properties. A MarkRead method. Create two books and mark one read.

4
00:00:33.006 --> 00:00:45.006
Practice checkpoint: Practice checkpoint: model one real-world thing as a class. Add one behaviour method. Then continue in the written Module 6 lesson and quiz.
